rify their identity, which is confirmed by the card issuer in real time. [Learn about Verified by Visa](/run-your-business/small-business-tools/payment-technology/visa-secure.html) ### Cybersource Services for processing online payments, streamlining fraud management and simplifying payment security. [Go to CyberSource](http://www.cybersource.com/) ------------------------------------------------------------------------ ## Suspect fraud? Trust your instincts! If a sale seems too good to be true, it probably is. We hear all too often that what a merchant thought was a great sale turned out to be fraud. So take the time to check out that

