# Visa Traveller's Cheques for Consumers _Last modified: 2019-10-23T09:14:04.044Z_ # Visa Traveller's Cheques Visa Traveller's Cheques offer convenience and security while you travel. [Contact us about traveller’s cheques](/supporting-info/travelers-cheques-contact-us.html) - [Report a lost cheque](#1) - [Request a refund](#2) - [Keep cheques safe](#3) ## Report a lost cheque If your cheques are lost or stolen, they can be replaced or refunded subject to certain terms and conditions. You should immediately call the issuing bank. If you cannot find the issuing bank’s contact details, [contact us about traveller’s cheques.](/supporting-info/travelers-cheques-contact-us.html) ### Issuing banks ### Banco do Brasil UK +44-1733-457026 Monday-Friday, 8 am to 5 pm GMT or BST [\[email protected\]](/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b8ccdbd9cbcbd1cbccd9d6dbddf8cccad9ceddd4ddc096dbd7d5) ### Bank of America 1-214-209-0519 Monday-Friday, 8 am to 4:30 pm CST [\[email protected\]](/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#691d1b081f0a01180d0c191d290b080702060f08040c1b000a08470a0604) ### Chase Manhattan UK +44-1733-457026 Monday-Friday, 8 am to 5 pm GMT or BST [\[email protected\]](/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#1266717361617b6166737c71775266607364777e776a3c717d7f) ### Citicorp Freephone: 1-800-645-6556 Collect: 1-813-623-1709 Monday-Friday, 6:30 am to 2:30 pm EST Automated cheque verification is available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week (if you select the English or Spanish option). If you need to speak to a customer service representative you can do so. Outside these hours calls will be recorded and responded to the next business day. [citicorp.traveller'\[email protected\]](/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#4d2e2439242e223f3d63393f2c3b282121283f3e632e25283c38283e0d2e243924632e2220) ### Interpayment Services Ltd UK+44-1733-279865 Monday-Friday, 8 am to 5 pm GMT or BST [\[email protected\]](/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e793848694948e949386898482a793958691828b829fc984888a) ### Sumitomo Freephone: Japan +800-08006666 [\[email protected\]](/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ec989e8d9a8980899e9f8f84899d99899fac898dc29f818e8fc28f83c2869c) ## Request a refund ### Have your info ready Before a refund can be arranged, the issuer will ask a few simple questions: - What are the cheque serial numbers? - Where and when did you buy the cheques? - How and when do you think the cheques were lost or stolen? - Who is the issuer of the traveller's cheques? The refund can usually be arranged within 24 hours, subject to certain terms and conditions being satisfied. ------------------------------------------------------------------------ ## Keep cheques safe What to know when using Visa Traveller's Cheques. - Be as careful with your cheques as you would be with cash. - Do not countersign the cheques until you want to use them. - Keep your purchase agreement separate from your cheques. - Write

