lters for precision #### You can request multiple filters at once: - "Environmental organizations in California with BIPOC leadership" - "Healthcare nonprofits in Texas with Platinum transparency seals" #### Ask follow-up questions Once you have results, dig deeper: - "Tell me more about [organization name]" - "What is this organization's mission?" - "Are there similar organizations in

